### Bookstore Inventory API (.NET 10)
### Start the stack: docker compose up --build

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Readiness (API and MongoDB) -> 200 healthy
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Generated OpenAPI document -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Scalar UI -> 200 outside Production
GET {{baseUrl}}/scalar/v1

### List all books (first page, 50 books maximum) -> 200 array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books

### List by category; category matching is case-insensitive -> 200 filtered array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books?category=programming&page=1&pageSize=25

### Unknown category -> 400 Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books?category=Poetry

### Search exact title or author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books?title=Test%20Driven%20Development

### Search exact author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books?author=Kent%20Beck

### Register a book -> 201 and Location header
# @name createBook
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Driven Development",
  "author": "Kent Beck",
  "category": "Programming",
  "quantity": 3,
  "description": "A book about TDD",
  "language": "English",
  "publisher": "Addison-Wesley",
  "publisherDate": "2002-11-08T10:00:00+02:00"
}

### Register with title only -> defaults to no category, zero stock, active
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Minimal" }

### Missing title -> 400 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "Nobody" }

### Negative quantity -> 400 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Invalid stock", "quantity": -1 }

### Malformed JSON -> 400 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title":

### Date without offset -> 400 Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Invalid date", "publisherDate": "2002-11-08T10:00:00" }

### Retrieve created book by ObjectId -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/{{createBook.response.body.id}}

### Malformed id -> 400 Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/not-an-object-id

### Unknown id -> 404 Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/000000000000000000000001

### Update only quantity; active state and other fields are preserved -> 200 full book
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/{{createBook.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 10 }

### Deactivate without changing quantity -> 200, inactiveDate is set
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/{{createBook.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }

### Reactivate -> 200, inactiveDate is cleared
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/{{createBook.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": true }

### Empty update -> 400 Problem Details
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/{{createBook.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Update unknown id -> 404 Problem Details
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/books/000000000000000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 4 }
